On available
    Say "Master!  <font color=@#990000@>[Mercenary Quartermaster] Mr. Osmond</font> is looking for you, Master, for the preparation of war materials"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "What shall we do with this.. It's huge trouble.. Gasp! Oh my! Not even a hint of your approaching. Oh, are you asking me what I am so worried about? It's because of the supply route for the provision of war materials."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "While we were trying to transport war materials for their provisioning, the violence of [Boss] monsters has become more severe. Consequently, the transportation plan is being delayed indefinitely. I wish someone would take care of these guys.. Oh! I think I can ask <selfname> a favor! Fortunately, you don't seem to have anything to do! As for a reward, I will talk to the Commander so that you can be richly rewarded. Please, do me this favor."

On in_progress
    Say "Um.. Not yet..? Oh.. My heart breaks when I think about the fellow soldiers who are suffering as the materials are not delivered!"

On ready
    Say "Is this guy the last one? Master! I took care of all the guys on the wanted list!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Oh! You took care of them all! Thank you. Now we can start the transporation! Here is your compensation. Do us a favor the next time too!"
